docs {
  # Upload API
  
  Endpoints untuk upload file/gambar.
  
  **Base URL:** `/api/upload`
  
  ---
  
  ## Endpoints
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | POST | `/image` | Upload single image | ✅ | All |
  | POST | `/images` | Upload multiple images (max 10) | ✅ | All |
  | DELETE | `/image/:filename` | Delete uploaded image | ✅ | All |
  
  ---
  
  ## Supported Formats
  
  - **Images:** jpg, jpeg, png, gif, webp, avif, heic, heif
  - **Max Size (image policy):** 5MB per file
  - **Max Count (multi-image):** 10 file
  
  ---
  
  ## Upload Directory
  
  Files are stored in `/uploads/images` with randomized filenames.

  ## Catatan Implementasi
  Endpoint upload image menggunakan facade:
  - `createUploadFacade("image")`
  - `createUploadErrorHandler({ maxFileSizeMb: 5 })`
}
